## Evaluation instruments — how you are scored, and how you score others

- **<course-link type="page" id="pg-rubrics">Assignment Rubrics</course-link>** — the analytic grid for every checkpoint assigned so far, with what each criterion rewards. Read the grid before you start the assignment.
- **<course-link type="page" id="pg-pitch-evaluation-sheet">Pitch Evaluation Sheet</course-link>** — what your classmates score on Pitch Day, including the question that actually decides teams.
- **<course-link type="page" id="pg-peer-evaluation-form">Peer Evaluation Form</course-link>** — confidential, scored against your own team charter, and taught as a skill rather than collected as a survey.

